tally: {'STRUCTURAL': 11, 'already-mints': 3, 'no-proposals': 1, 'CALIBRATION': 6}

STRUCTURAL    b* <= 0 -- the definition term alone outweighs the saving; no b rescues it.
CALIBRATION   0 < b* <= 1 -- some b below the current 1.0 would mint.
already-mints b* > 1 -- minting already wins at b = 1.0 (recovery can still be 0 if what
              it mints is not the authored rung -- see 94f9d214-nor-recolor).
